	(text "These are the required control bits for the ALU.\nCn S0 S1 S2 S3  M\n1   0  0  0  0   0  A\n1   1  0  0  1   0  A plus B\nX   0  1  0  0   1  A nand B\n\nCn is hardwired to 1\nS2 is hardwired to 0\n\nMUXalu3 is a microcode ROM control signal.\nIt select the source of ALU function.\nALU0, ALU1, ALU2, ALU3 are encoded in ALU instruction.\nFUNCalu0, FUNCalu1, FUNCalu2, FUNCalu3 come from microcode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.272 39.624 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ffc343f2-993e-486d-bf59-6c091929fbfc")
	)
